[00:00.000]...
[00:23.597]How do I have to change?
{"我该如何改变自己？"}
[00:26.755]Do you think it's not enough? I gave it all
{"你觉得还不够吗？我已倾尽所有"}
[00:29.818]What have I got to do to make myself be chosen?
{"要怎样做才能被选中？"}
[00:35.995]No second thoughts for me
{"我绝不犹豫"}
[00:38.617]Just wanna be a man or a hero
{"只想成为真正的男人或英雄"}
[00:41.798]Unconsciously I wonder how to be The Special
{"潜意识里思索着如何成为那个特别的存在"}
[00:48.209]Dive into the depth of my heart
{"潜入心灵最深处"}
[00:54.316]Find myself feeling childish fears
{"发现自己仍怀着幼稚的恐惧"}
[01:00.022]The invisible hand of the God
{"神明无形的双手"}
[01:02.967]Had made us burst their ancient locks
{"已让我们冲破古老的枷锁"}
[01:05.914]And now, the world I trusted breaks apart at the seams
{"如今 我曾信任的世界正分崩离析"}
[01:12.622]Gotta burn my pride
{"必须燃烧我的骄傲"}
[01:14.106]We'll take a chance to make them crystalize
{"我们要抓住机会让它们结晶成形"}
[01:18.611]No one knows our beasts inside will be the demons or the saints
{"无人知晓内心野兽终成恶魔还是圣徒"}
[01:24.602]Never doubt myself
{"永不怀疑自己"}
[01:26.111]Show me your justice, 'cause you realize
{"展示你的正义吧 因为你已明白"}
[01:30.103]So long now, my friend
{"再会了 我的朋友"}
[01:32.842]Have a brighter day tomorrow
{"愿你的明天更加灿烂"}
[01:36.674]...
[01:50.764]How do I have to change?
{"我该如何改变自己？"}
[01:53.593]Small things will bring and begin big impacts
{"微小事物终将引发巨大影响"}
[01:56.747]His paper castle's gone
{"他的纸城堡已崩塌"}
[01:59.647]Entire ground's still been frozen
{"整片大地依旧冰封"}
[02:02.850]Slipped into evil's sway, he kept on building the lies and fictions
{"滑入邪恶的掌控 他不断编织谎言与虚构"}
[02:08.839]We all got lost within ourselves what we should believe in
{"我们都迷失在自我 不知该信仰什么"}
[02:15.247]Dive into the depth of my heart
{"潜入心灵最深处"}
[02:21.261]Find myself feeling childish fears
{"发觉自己竟怀揣稚嫩恐惧"}
[02:27.155]The invisible hand of the God
{"神明无形之手的操控"}
[02:30.009]Had made us burst their ancient locks
{"迫使我们冲破古老枷锁"}
[02:33.004]And now, the world I trusted breaks apart at the seams
{"如今 我曾信赖的世界正分崩离析"}
[02:39.691]Gotta light my pride
{"必须点燃我的骄傲"}
[02:41.082]We'll take a chance to make them crystalize
{"我们要抓住机会让它们凝结成型"}
[02:45.587]No one knows our beasts inside will be the demons or the saints
{"无人知晓内心猛兽终成恶魔还是圣徒"}
[02:51.578]Never doubt myself
{"绝不怀疑自我"}
[02:53.087]Show me your justice, 'cause you realize
{"展现你的正义吧 因你已了然"}
[02:57.000]So long now, my friend
{"再会了 我的朋友"}
[02:59.925]Have a brighter day tomorrow
{"愿明日迎来更灿烂曙光"}
[03:06.264]Thousand tears call the shadow of the nightmare
{"千行泪水召唤梦魇阴影"}
[03:12.255]Thousand years past, longing for the future
{"千年逝去 仍渴望着未来"}
[03:18.246]Thousand grief shed cruelty and their blood but
{"万千悲恸倾泻残酷与鲜血 然而"}
[03:24.260]Thousand beliefs will salvage our souls
{"无数信念终将救赎我们灵魂"}
